#: model:ir.model.fields,help:webship.field_res_config_settings__webship_domain
msgid "Optional Odoo domain filter to restrict which pickings are automatically synced to Stoqflow. Only pickings matching this filter will be synced. Example: [('mk_instance_id','in',[2,3])] to only sync orders from specific marketplace instances."
msgstr "Optional Odoo domain filter to restrict which pickings are automatically synced to Stoqflow. Only pickings matching this filter will be synced. Example: [('mk_instance_id','in',[2,3])] to only sync orders from specific marketplace instances."

#. module: webship
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:webship.field_res_config_settings__webship_login
